v=Text("Limitations","h2")
w=Text("Gene therapy may give durable benefit, but it can be limited by immune responses, vector size constraints, and imperfect control of where and how strongly the added gene is expressed.",source:""},x=Text("CRISPR offers site-specific editing, but limitations include off-target edits, incomplete editing, dependence on repair pathways, and difficulty achieving uniform correction in all target cells.",source:""},y=Text("Both approaches face major delivery barriers, but CRISPR adds an extra layer of risk because a cut can create unintended DNA changes rather than simply adding a gene.",source:"[13]"]
